WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.475
- INTERMISSION!
- [hums]

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:13.746
both: OH,<i> OTHELLO</i>
IS MY SHITE!

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:16.883
- [bleep]-ETH, YEAH.
-<i> OTHELLO,</i> MOTHER[bleep]!

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:20.186
[both imitating
swordplay sounds]

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:22.755
- [bleep],
YOU DEAD, WHITE PERSON.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:25.058
[laughter]
OH, THIS PLAY DOTH SEEM DOPE

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:27.160
TO ME, MARTINSIA.
- VERILY, LASHAWNIA.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.861
VERILY.
YO, AND 'TIS ABOUT TIME

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:31.864
SHAKESPEARE DOTH SCRIVEN
THE PLAY THAT PLACES A BROTHER

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.900
AMONGST THE FIRMAMENTS.
- THAT'S MY SHITE!

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.768
- OH, WHO'S YOUR FAVORITE
CHARACTER?

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.070
MINE'S OTHELLO.
- OH, 'TIS MINE AS WELL.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.239
'TIS MINE AS WELL.
- BECAUSE THEY GOT OTHELLO

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:42.274
AS A GENERAL.
I'M SAYING, HELLETH, YES.

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:43.876
- AND OTHELLO DID THE BEAST
WITH TWO BACKS

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:45.611
WITH THAT COMELY WHITE MAIDEN,

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:48.047
AND DIDST NOT ANYONE
SPEAKETH AGAINST HIM.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.849
- MM.
- HE STRAIGHT PIMPIN'.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:53.452
- METHINKS THINGS ARE LOOKING UP
FOR PEOPLE OF THE DARKER HUE.

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:55.154
- DAMN STRAIGHT.
- HOO.

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:57.891
both: ♪ HEY, NONNY, NONNY,
TALKING HEY, NONNY, NONNY ♪

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.559
- COME ON.
- OH, HEY, MARTINSIA.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:02.061
- MM.
- WOULDST THAT I COULD BORROW

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:03.963
A COUPLE OF DUCATS
TO PURCHASETH A CAPON

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.231
FROM YONDER CONCESSION?

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.199
- PSSH, MOOR, PLEASE.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:08.968
YOU KNOW I GOT
A CONCEALED CORNISH GAME HEN

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.103
UP IN MY DOUBLET.
- OOH, ALLOWETH ME TO PARTAKETH

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.771
UP IN THIS BITCH.
- OKAY, OKAY.

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:15.141
GET IN THERE.
[bell dings]

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.143
- THE SECOND ACT
IS ABOUT TO BEGIN.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.578
- COME ON, Y'ALL.
Y'ALL HEARD THE URSHER.

00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:21.881
- IF I KNOW SHAKESPEARE,
OTHELLO'S ABOUT TO KILL

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.284
EVERYBODY UP IN THIS BITCH.
[laughs]

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:34.226
NO, NO, NO,
MM-MM, I HATETH THIS PLAY.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:36.128
- HOW THEY GONNA KILL OTHELLO?

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:38.431
- MAN, THAT TRIFLING ASS IAGO,
I KNEW HE WAS UP TO SOMETHING.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.765
THEY SHOULD HAVE KILLED HIM
IN THE FIRST ACT.

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:41.734
- HOW THEY GONNA KILL OTHELLO?

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.970
- HOW OTHELLO GONNA DO HIMSELF
IN WITH A DAGGER

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.971
HOW DOTH THAT HAPPEN?
- LET ME TELL YOU SOMETHING,

00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:48.174
IF A BROTHER KILL HIMSELF
EVERY TIME HE BROKE UP

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.576
WITH A WHITE BITCH, THIS WORLD
WOULD BE BEREFT OF BROTHERS.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:51.945
- YOU'D BE TALKING
TO A SKULL RIGHT NOW.

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:54.447
- OKAY?
- WHERE'S SHAKESPEARES AT?

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.248
- SHAKESPEARES.
- OH, HE'S RIGHT THERE.

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.217
both: PRITHEE.
PRITHEE.

00:01:58.217 --> 00:01:59.285
- MAKE WAY.
PRITHEE. MAKE WAY.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.621
BE GONE, CIRA.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.990
YOU KILLED OTHELLO!
- A BLACK MAN GOT IT GOING ON,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.358
AND YOU SHUFFLE OFF
HIS MORTAL COIL?

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:07.460
- I SAY UNTO THEE
THAT'S A TRAGEDY.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.895
- MM-HMM.
- OH, 'TIS THAT NOT

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.797
THE TROUBADOUR KANYE
OF THE WEST?

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.399
- WHAT? WHERE'S--
WAIT.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.767
- TRUTH BE TOLD, MY LORDS,

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.436
'TIS NOT I WHO PENNED
THIS DREADFUL PLAY.

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:20.105
'TWAS CHRISTOPHER MARLOWE.
both: NAY, NAY, NAY.

00:02:20.105 --> 00:02:22.674
- YES, IT WAS.
- THOU ALREADY TRIED TO USE

00:02:22.674 --> 00:02:24.376
THAT LINE OF ARGUMENT
WHEN THE JEWS WANTED

00:02:24.376 --> 00:02:26.012
TO KICK YOUR ASS
AFTER<i> THE MERCHANT OF VENICE.</i>

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.546
- WE DOTH NOT PURCHASE IT,
SLICK WILLY.

00:02:27.546 --> 00:02:29.181
WE DOTH NOT PURCHASE IT.

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:31.216
- BE CALM, MY GOOD LORDS.

00:02:31.216 --> 00:02:33.686
'TWILL NOT BE LONG
BEFORE ANOTHER BLACK HERO

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:36.388
GRACETH THE STAGE, AND NOW
IF YOU'LL LET ME TAKE MY LEAVE.

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:38.557
- NOT SO FAST.

00:02:38.557 --> 00:02:43.829
YOU GOING TO WRITE
THAT HERO NOW.

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:49.335
- VERILY THAT, MOTHER[bleep].

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:57.310
[both exclaiming
and imitating funk music]

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.812
THAT JOHN SHAFTE
IS ONE BAD MOTHER--

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:00.880
- SHUT THAT MOUTH.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.382
- I JUST SPEAKETH ABOUT SHAFTE.
- MM.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.118
- YO, LEVI, MAN.

